WEBVTT

00:01.180 --> 00:03.350
<b>That's Sawashiro-san?</b>

00:04.120 --> 00:05.750
<b>It's cute.</b>

00:25.640 --> 00:29.510
<b>In the original artwork,
does Dejiko wear a stomach wrap?</b>

00:29.610 --> 00:34.710
<b>I think so. It's the usual wear
for street vendors.</b>

00:34.820 --> 00:36.950
<b>Stomach wrap and a happi coat.</b>

00:38.420 --> 00:42.860
<b>Hitting the table
and yelling out loud.</b>

00:43.130 --> 00:44.930
<b>At festivals and such.</b>

00:44.930 --> 00:46.520
<b>At festivals and such.</b>

00:47.400 --> 00:49.130
<b>This is it!</b>

00:50.400 --> 00:52.300
<b>Right. Abarenbou.</b>

01:01.810 --> 01:06.110
<b>This is a completely original character
by the director.</b>

01:09.790 --> 01:15.420
<b>I like how the outline is different
from the other characters.</b>

01:21.600 --> 01:23.160
<b>Yes, it's subtle,</b>

01:24.800 --> 01:28.170
<b>but he looks different.</b>

01:28.810 --> 01:30.570
<b>Here's the song.</b>

01:34.340 --> 01:36.140
<b>This song is-</b>

01:39.780 --> 01:42.180
<b>Director Sakurai wrote it.</b>

01:43.020 --> 01:45.180
<b>He probably performed it too.</b>

02:09.780 --> 02:11.410
<b>Everyone looks stunned.</b>

02:11.520 --> 02:15.980
<b>This character is all about his force.</b>

02:18.290 --> 02:23.350
<b>He overwhelms everyone.</b>

02:24.130 --> 02:26.690
<b>He's hard to comment on.</b>

02:27.500 --> 02:29.360
<b>That's a big rice ball.</b>

02:32.140 --> 02:36.630
<b>And this fish sausage,
I don't think you see that often.</b>

02:36.740 --> 02:39.370
<b>It's a sausage</b>

02:39.480 --> 02:44.240
<b>made out of fish.</b>

02:46.750 --> 02:49.120
<b>It's different from fish cake.</b>

02:49.220 --> 02:54.320
<b>There's an impression that
it's an inexpensive food.</b>

03:22.950 --> 03:25.420
<b>Is this a parody of something?</b>

03:26.290 --> 03:28.150
<b>I don't know what this is.</b>

03:31.560 --> 03:40.430
<b>Note: ''The North'' is a Japanese TV series
about a family in Hokkaido.
Specials run every year.
</b>

03:31.560 --> 03:34.700
<b>Is it from ''The North'' or something?</b>

03:36.430 --> 03:40.430
<b>Gema's the only one who's moved.</b>

03:40.700 --> 03:42.190
<b>Just Gema?</b>
